WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.900
Founder: Sarah, I am ready with my notebook — tell me what you need.

00:02.900 --> 00:06.200
Client: Consistency. I keep starting over and I need a plan that sticks.

00:06.200 --> 00:10.200
Founder: Noted. We lock training days, simple meals, and one weekly check-in.

00:10.200 --> 00:12.800
Client: Yes — that is exactly what I needed to hear.

00:12.800 --> 00:15.100
Founder: Good. You leave with clear next steps today.
